        "original_id": "63f1ec4e-c1b6-5b40-beeb-1a90db5c48e7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dave Wyndorf, Poly Styrene, Marianne Joan Elliott-Said\n- Organizations: Monster Magnet, X-Ray Spex\n- Products: Love Monster (EP)\n- Roles: songwriter, lead vocalist, guitarist, musician, singer-songwriter, frontwoman\n\nFacts:\n- Dave Wyndorf was born as David Albert Wyndorf on October 28, 1956.\n- Poly Styrene was born as Marianne Joan Elliott-Said on July 3, 1957.\n- In 1988, Dave Wyndorf recorded all songs on the EP Love Monster a year before Monster Magnet was formed.\n- Dave Wyndorf is the songwriter, lead vocalist, and a guitarist for the American rock group Monster Magnet.\n- Poly Styrene, who died on April 25, 2011, was a British musician, singer-songwriter, and frontwoman for the punk rock band X-Ray Spex.\n- Love Monster is an EP released by Monster Magnet.",
